# host 2026-11-12 00:42 (recording 20261111_194240): the user switched from the
# game to Claude. Chrome, covered by it a moment ago and drawing until then,
# gave 1.5 GB in five pieces for Claude's headroom, got 869 MB back two
# seconds later ("drawing again, not visible"), gave 975 MB again and got 264
# back: 3.6 GB of copies and a dozen pauses of 20-40 ms in four seconds, at
# the moment the user starts to work with the window.
#   - the headroom (2112 MB) is kept for any focused window, while what comes
#     back by itself left only the low mark (1280 MB) free unless the focus
#     was a game: whatever went out for the headroom and was smaller than the
#     difference came straight back and went out again;
#   - "drawing steadily" was counted from before it was moved out, so the
#     frames Chrome drew as a visible window brought it back as a hidden one.
cap 11000
proc 1614 kwin_wayland old
proc 1625 plasmashell old
proc 5000 Wow.exe old chunk=64
proc 7000 chrome old chunk=32
proc 9000 claude-desktop old chunk=16

hint 1625 v
hint 5000 f launched
hint 7000 v
hint 9000 h
act 1614 0 4
act 1625 0 4
act 5000 0 30
act 7000 0 6
act 9000 300 0
target 1614 280 0.75
target 1625 480 0.4
target 5000 6000 0.75
target 7000 2400 0.8
place 9000 300 484 0.9
at 20

mark the user switches to Claude, its window covers Chrome; Claude gets its memory back and grows
hint 9000 f
hint 5000 v
hint 7000 h
act 9000 0 8
step
target 9000 900 0.9 spread=3      # below 1 GB: not what the policy takes for a game
at 24
expect sys 9000 == 0
expect evicted 7000 > 0          # the headroom came from the window just covered

mark Chrome draws on for twelve seconds (a page finishing its work) while Claude grows a little more, then stops
at 32
target 9000 980 0.9 spread=4
at 36
act 7000 30 0
at 80
expect restores 7000 == 0        # nothing came back to go out again
expect pingpong 7000 == 0
expect bounce_mb 7000 == 0       # the number `evict.sh status` shows
expect evicts 7000 < 6

mark the user looks at Chrome again: all of it is back at once
hint 7000 f
hint 9000 v
act 7000 0 6
step
at 84
expect sys 7000 == 0
